WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.816
A CTE has a simple structure WITH gives the stage a
name

00:00:07.551 --> 00:00:13.631
The query inside the parentheses defines the rows
and columns of that stage The

00:00:13.658 --> 00:00:19.456
final query can read the CTE by name You can also
define several

00:00:19.483 --> 00:00:25.246
CTEs separated by commas The CTE is not a permanent

00:00:25.272 --> 00:00:28.353
table It belongs to the statement
